  "setup": "RoCE over ConnectX-7 (RoCE v2 GID index auto-detected per node from HCA rocep1s0f0,rocep1s0f1); weights exported from head to worker via NFS docker volume (NFS_SHARE=1, files/nfs-share.sh); image built locally then docker save|ssh docker load to worker; patches/ bind-mounted at /opt/mimo26/patches (sitecustomize.py fixes MTP draft fused-qkv scale load at TP=2); boot.py/patches/state bind-mounted into container; optional host NCCL 2.30.7 overlay off by default (NCCL_OVERLAY_PIP=0)",
